            "created_at": "2025-07-06T23:07:50.378074+00:00",
            "notes": "So for the first round we are buying  [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) or  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) which seem kinda lackluster but are really good for surviving encounters with other DPS among other things. You also want to buy [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) and  [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) to get extra damage which means more cash.\n\n [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) doesn't really provide enough healing, however it can be bought later into the game to stack onto better lifesteal items like  [Competitive Analysis](item_168f8109-d2cc-40cc-a6bb-2006a2f62939) \n\nIf you want you can get  [Ammo Reserves](item_982d53aa-5ef4-493f-93e7-9e374d0ebf34) however idk if the 1 extra bullet really helps more than the extra health.\n\nFor the perk you want  [Just Roll With It](item_71918d53-d84e-48f1-9940-8fbe0d9d5a41) it improves your survivability and gives you a much better chance against other dps. This is kinda non-negotiable as it greatly improves your odds of winning DPS 1v1s and helps you last longer against tanks.",
