            "notes": "For round 2 you want  [Stockpile](item_a113eb56-9999-4f22-9bd7-18f4dbd00cc2) for the extra 2 ammo. This lets you kill 2 DPS/Support with 1 clip from 25m assuming you dont miss and only hit body-shots.\n\nWith  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) All DPS become a 4-hit at most and a 2-headshot from 25m and under. So its pretty valuable.\n\nIf you cant afford  [Stockpile](item_a113eb56-9999-4f22-9bd7-18f4dbd00cc2) sell  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) and/or   [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf)",
