        {
            "id": "492929c0-ec2e-4596-a204-bf1f03b63808",
            "build_id": "41da3f2d-7474-4b0e-a94c-432e4c4182b4",
            "round_number": 3,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-07-06T23:07:50.378074+00:00",
            "notes": "Round 3 you either want to pick  [Full House](item_0001a9dc-79d5-48c9-92b0-85060efd897e) if you want more damage or [Bullseye](item_19cf3c95-5071-425e-beba-30af6ba15ef1) \n\nDon't get  [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) if the enemy team's tank doesn't have armor. \n\nIf they have a Reinhardt or some other tank, just keep dumping rounds into the tank easy money\n\nIn many other guides i see  [Quick Draw](item_fce335e5-8093-4936-98c1-12ee26efd5d3) being used but when I play its kinda bad cause it autolocks onto their body, not their head. It also only applies to 1 bullet, and you have to be in 9m range to activate it anyways, and atp if youre missing bodyshots from 9m and under youre cooked.\n\nThe reason we arent getting [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb) and  [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429) is because Cassidy's abilities have a long cooldown time with no real reliable way to shorten them down unless you either hit tons of headshots and/or get 4 kills with your ult.\n\nGet  [Competitive Analysis](item_168f8109-d2cc-40cc-a6bb-2006a2f62939)  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) and  [Stockpile](item_a113eb56-9999-4f22-9bd7-18f4dbd00cc2) if youre 1v1ing DPS. You may want to replace  [Stockpile](item_a113eb56-9999-4f22-9bd7-18f4dbd00cc2) with Survival items. Its usually better to get an item that helps kill the other tank though. Cassidy should play near their tank\n\n [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) if your problem is survivability. The reason I'm choosing it over [Frankie\u2019s Fixer](item_6fb21e33-bbfa-4810-ba46-d9fbc6bbcc3a) is because it gives back armor/shield, aswell as activating when you do a flashbang aswell, so  [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) is arguably better in most scenarios. \n\nA while back I was considering using  [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) however its very situational, I think you should only use it if the other team is consistently shutting down your ult with Dva, Mei, Genji, etc. However even then I don't know. Just learn how to use your ultimate effectively.\n\nIf the tank is a problem, get \n\n[Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) if they are a Reinhardt or Dva or Orisa. Also get  [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) if you have enough money.\n\nWith Zarya youre kinda screwed, just don't shoot her bubble and go for her teammates, and then she drops pretty fast.\n\n[El-sa'ka Supressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100) or [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) if you don't hit headshots reliably, and if they are a Junker Queen. \n\nIf you want a good all-rounder get  [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b)\n\nIf you did bad, get  [Quickload Chamber](item_fc0bca6b-2c96-44bc-8d77-0acc8defa436) or  [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) or  [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016).",
