            "notes": "Okay now you want to pick your 2nd Epic. \n\n[Competitive Analysis](item_168f8109-d2cc-40cc-a6bb-2006a2f62939) if your problem is 1V1s against DPS.\n\n[Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) if your problem is survivability. The reason I'm choosing it over [Frankie\u2019s Fixer](item_6fb21e33-bbfa-4810-ba46-d9fbc6bbcc3a) is because it gives back armor/shield, aswell as activating when you do a flashbang aswell, so  [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) is arguably better in most scenarios.\n\nIf the tank is a problem, get [Salvaged Slugs](item_019d6c60-36eb-42ec-8d6e-5bbb44a0db61) if they are a Zarya or Reinhardt\n\n[Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) if they are a Reinhardt or Dva or Orisa \n\n[El-sa'ka Supressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100) or [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) if you don't hit headshots reliably, and if they are a Junker Queen. HOWEVER only get  [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) if you are able to coordinate with your team to focus all damage on the JQ for the short 2 seconds. If not get  [El-sa'ka Supressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100) \n\nIf you want a good all-rounder get  [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) or  [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce)\n\n [Commander's Clip](item_ff7cad01-2065-4908-a2c1-3bdf1458c7a4) is also a strong option\n\nIf you did bad, get  [Quickload Chamber](item_fc0bca6b-2c96-44bc-8d77-0acc8defa436) or  [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) or  [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016).",
